      "questionName": "x",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p>Anna: Hi, Jack! How was your morning on the farm?</p>\n<p>Jack: Busy as always! I had to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-895260-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-895260-0' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-895260-0' /></span></strong> the pigs and <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-895260-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-895260-1' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-895260-1' /></span></strong> the hay onto the truck. What about you?</p>\n<p>Anna: That sounds like a busy day! I went for a walk earlier, and the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-895260-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-895260-2' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-895260-2' /></span></strong> around your farm is beautiful. The fields seem to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-895260-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-895260-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-895260-3' /></span></strong> endlessly.</p>\n<p>Jack: I agree. That&#8217;s one of the reasons I love living here. Life is hard work, but it&#8217;s also <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.5</label><input id='fbo-895260-4' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='4' name='fbo-895260-4' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-895260-4' /></span></strong> in its own way.</p>\n<p>Anna: By the way, do you all <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.6</label><input id='fbo-895260-5' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='5' name='fbo-895260-5' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-895260-5' /></span></strong> well with your neighbors?</p>\n<p>Jack: Oh, definitely. We often help each other, especially during harvest season. Everyone here is so hospitable.</p>\n<p>Anna: That&#8217;s great to hear!&nbsp;By the way, do you know what the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.7</label><input id='fbo-895260-6' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='6' name='fbo-895260-6' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-895260-6' /></span></strong> of Billy's store is? It&#8217;s always crowded.</p>\n<p>Jack: It&#8217;s their <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.8</label><input id='fbo-895260-7' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='7' name='fbo-895260-7' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-895260-7' /></span></strong> cheese, and it&#8217;s really good. I think you should give it a try.</p>\n<p>Anna: Thanks, Jack! I&#8217;ll definitely check it out.</p>",
